<dl><dd>The toolset can open ERFs. Just use the File-&gt;Open command and locate the ERF to open. Then right-click on a file in the list and select "Extract Resource" (or alternatively you can use "Extract All Resources" to dump the contents of the entire ERF somewhere). <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/User%20-%20Nezroy" title="User:Nezroy (page does not exist)">Nezroy</a> 18:01, 26 February 2010 (UTC)</dd></dl>
